succ, pow_succ', mul_comm m.succ, Nat.cast_mul,\n        ← div_div, mul_div_assoc, mul_div_right_comm, Complex.norm_mul, Complex.norm_div,\n        norm_natCast]\n      gcongr\n      exact le_trans hm (Nat.le_succ _)","start":35,"end":45},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}